Course project of DTU *02806 Social data analysis and visualization*. [Link to the 02806 Project](http://msrtea7.com/posts/academic/02806_project)

- Year: 2025
- Skill covered:

  Social data analysis. Visualization techniques with python and js. Narrative visualization.

### **Beer brewing and safe food production**

Course project of DTU *23532 – Beer Brewing*. [Link to the report diagrams](https://msrtea7.com/posts/alcohol/beer_production/)
